to all referred elements.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Assigns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> to all of the elements.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Assigns the elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">val_arr</span></code> to the referred to elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Assigns the selected elements from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other_arr</span></code> to the referred to elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a value to assign to all of the referred elements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> val_arr\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray\">std::valarray</a></span> to assign\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other_arr\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/valarray/mask_array\">std::mask_array</a></span> to assign\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> (none)</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;valarray&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numer